    "detailed_description": "Teku is an island-building game using hexagonal tiles.<br>You have a deck of tiles to place on specific, randomly-generated locations.<br><br>Your goal is to score as many points as possible by positioning the tiles correctly in relation to each other. <br>Each type of tile scores points in different ways.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660750/extras/0e516c6d48b5cdd7e8a2da652ffb25fd.avif?t=1700028661\" width=616 height=64 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660750/extras/d8469e425157a0b8b28e91de7472ef33.poster.avif?t=1700028661\" width=616 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660750/extras/d8469e425157a0b8b28e91de7472ef33.webm?t=1700028661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660750/extras/d8469e425157a0b8b28e91de7472ef33.mp4?t=1700028661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660750/extras/0e516c6d48b5cdd7e8a2da652ffb25fd.avif?t=1700028661\" width=616 height=64 /></span><br><br>During the game, you'll be taken through levels, each with its own rules, scoring objectives and tiles to assemble. Each game is short, lasting just a few minutes, ideal for short play sessions or the hunt for the top score.<br><br>When you start, two game modes are immediately available:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Classic</strong> mode, in which you must place all the tiles in your deck to finish the game.<br></li><li> <strong>Challenge</strong> mode, in which you unlock new tiles as you score points. In this mode, you can place the tiles wherever you like.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660750/extras/0e516c6d48b5cdd7e8a2da652ffb25fd.avif?t=1700028661\" width=616 height=64 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660750/extras/61e782f8681b0eff4cb9e1edf6fc21b1.poster.avif?t=1700028661\" width=616 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660750/extras/61e782f8681b0eff4cb9e1edf6fc21b1.webm?t=1700028661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660750/extras/61e782f8681b0eff4cb9e1edf6fc21b1.mp4?t=1700028661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Teku is an island-building game using hexagonal tiles.<br>You have a deck of tiles to place on specific, randomly-generated locations.<br><br>Your goal is to score as many points as possible by positioning the tiles correctly in relation to each other. <br>Each type of tile scores points in different ways.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660750/extras/0e516c6d48b5cdd7e8a2da652ffb25fd.avif?t=1700028661\" width=616 height=64 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660750/extras/d8469e425157a0b8b28e91de7472ef33.poster.avif?t=1700028661\" width=616 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660750/extras/d8469e425157a0b8b28e91de7472ef33.webm?t=1700028661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660750/extras/d8469e425157a0b8b28e91de7472ef33.mp4?t=1700028661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660750/extras/0e516c6d48b5cdd7e8a2da652ffb25fd.avif?t=1700028661\" width=616 height=64 /></span><br><br>During the game, you'll be taken through levels, each with its own rules, scoring objectives and tiles to assemble. Each game is short, lasting just a few minutes, ideal for short play sessions or the hunt for the top score.<br><br>When you start, two game modes are immediately available:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Classic</strong> mode, in which you must place all the tiles in your deck to finish the game.<br></li><li> <strong>Challenge</strong> mode, in which you unlock new tiles as you score points. In this mode, you can place the tiles wherever you like.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660750/extras/0e516c6d48b5cdd7e8a2da652ffb25fd.avif?t=1700028661\" width=616 height=64 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660750/extras/61e782f8681b0eff4cb9e1edf6fc21b1.poster.avif?t=1700028661\" width=616 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660750/extras/61e782f8681b0eff4cb9e1edf6fc21b1.webm?t=1700028661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660750/extras/61e782f8681b0eff4cb9e1edf6fc21b1.mp4?t=1700028661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
